Comment: 0,0:23:29.35,0:23:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow at noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not go to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back.\NReturn to your cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dad.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Jongalli A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jongalli A, without a doubt,\Nhas a Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know that you're a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The handcuffs!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When did I take them off?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, get away from the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, The World!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Time, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh! The fight is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aerodynamics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.67,0:01:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It detects our positions\nthrough aerodynamics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move until we've figured out\nwhat this thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop giving me orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:17.64,TiretsDefault,,751,0,0,,– I've got it!\N– You… FE40536!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch, who do you think you're talking to?\NYou little mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.07,0:01:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:30.95,TiretsDefault,,756,0,0,,– You…\N– Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It will detect our positions again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jongalli A uses this Stand\Nto read air currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It might even be able to react\Nto our breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that,\Nthis Stand can be used at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jongalli A can shoot the Stand\nso the bullet bounces toward its target.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A precision Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't attack Jongalli A,\Nbecause he's in the men's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only option\nis to destroy his Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All damage dealt to the Stand\nbounces back to its user.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Only problem:\Nfrom the moment we attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the Stand will detect our position\nand Jongalli A will shoot us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close to the wall, Jolyne!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's detecting your position!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,what's your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't rely\Non your own muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When the skin feels a breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the muscles have a contraction reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That reflex\nis automatic and uncontrollable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I position the rifle\nwith my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones stay firm against the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The rifle is as stable\nas the surface itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust this method.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteorologists believe\nthe direction of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,cannot be predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be partly true,\Nbut not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this fly flying at random?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It flies according\Nto smells and air currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind is the fly's movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard said it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to see his daughter, Jolyne Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Joestar bloodline is in the visiting room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,right this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:06:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Within reach of my power,\NDowntown Transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My life will finally begin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,once I've eradicated\nyour family's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for taking away\nmy spiritual support!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to destroy it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at its movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It can no longer feel the air\nbecause of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn! Stone Free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait! Look closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's avoiding every single drop of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It can avoid the water\nby reading its aerodynamic trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, press yourself against the wall!\NIt's going to shoot us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is really bad.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the guards arrive, the air will move.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.38,TiretsDefault,,767,0,0,,– Listen to me!\N– What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, move the base of the pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit it, as hard as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:27.76,TiretsDefault,,539,0,0,,– But you…\N– Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?\NDon't forget what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's a hole at the bottom of the wall\nthat leads downward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a secret passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it leads to the sewers\nor the ventilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it leads outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jolyne.\NIt's our only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.63,TiretsDefault,,790,0,0,,– It's gone…\N– No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply looking\nfor the best angle to shoot us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on the other side,\Nit's chasing the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to hunt him down\nbecause he helped us escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, we go through the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to set you free!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I came in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,he grabbed my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable, but he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just an ordinary kid,\Nlike the ones you see at the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And we don't know each other.\NWe're perfect strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,he grabbed my arm\nwith despair in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,From the warmth of his hand,\NI felt that he pitied me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he kills the kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill Jongalli A!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The visiting room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire alarm just went off\nin the visiting room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no cameras in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:29.51,TiretsDefault,,739,0,0,,– Ready to fire!\N{\i1}– Where did he go?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That boy…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How does he move around{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}by appearing\Nand disappearing all of a sudden?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it! To visiting room B!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he dig this hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This wall… So he went through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about 1.40 m tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a frail build,\Nalmost like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but the hole that opened up\nleads to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where it leads\nby reading the air current.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that little guy\nlead Jotaro and his daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,into an underground tunnel\nwhere I can no longer reach them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose them a second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, I finish off the kid!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,our situation is looking bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Stands can only\ndefend us for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we strike,\Nit will be able to read the air movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave the visiting room that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the prison side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:54.43,TiretsDefault,,640,0,0,,– Damn it.\N– Go through the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just as I thought,\Nit's chasing the boy!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there are no windows in here.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How can it aim\nfrom the men's prison?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No… But then…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That boy… Look at him!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,His body is completely submerged,\Nthe air can't reach him anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's inside a drainage pipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jongalli A can't find him anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And there are no windows in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So he can't shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The pipe is bursting open! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he aiming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance to target: 321 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet loses 9.5 cm of altitude\nduring its flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and a light ocean breeze is blowing\nat 3.2 meters per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet will drift\n4.2 cm to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Target: the kid's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Strings!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jolyne Kujo's Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She followed him into the ventilation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your net\Ncan stop my bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of target: Jolyne Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for the forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I ruptured\nthat drainage pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When I came in here,\NI punctured that gas pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That gas is lighter than air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.62,0:13:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It creates a layer of gas\nseparated from the oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured it would\nkeep him from aiming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late! You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you couldn't aim\nat your own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a child like you\nroam around freely in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I hurt myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a bone. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And you tried to keep me\nfrom going to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. I can't, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That smell,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,was that your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.95,0:14:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Stand of that sniper,\Nthat Jongalli A?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I tore it to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem well used\nto fighting with your Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here! Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide! He has a rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hiding behind that pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He went above the water tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.74,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He was in the men's prison,\N200 or 300 meters from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tons of bars\nseparating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that,\Nhe's almost completely blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he have moved so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I say he's here,\Nthen he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas must have built up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.09,0:16:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.15,0:16:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here and explain everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.09,0:16:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see where he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand a word of what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Which boy are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't see him, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking with a child near the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Jongalli A tried to get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, our versions don't match up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have heard him talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I know you heard him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who told us\nabout the secret passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You were with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a ghost or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what passage you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole! You're messing with me\nat a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here because you followed me\nthrough the secret tunnel...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.65,0:17:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wound...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You took a bullet. Where's your wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet you took from Jongalli A!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In the right shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not bleeding, and your clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a single scratch either!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That man...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Jongalli A!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw him\ntake a bullet to the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, he took a bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is Jongalli A?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something's off.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing makes sense anymore!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A fate worse than death\nwill await us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not go to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The visiting room…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. Something's been off from the start.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When did they take the handcuffs off me?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that bullet…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I really get shot back there?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dad and I, we're unharmed.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.69,0:18:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was Jongalli A really attacking us?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something's off.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing makes sense!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in some kind of dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, someone put a spell on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I really did
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,knock out that guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That photo of Jongalli A,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad is the one who showed it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The accident with the hitchhiker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The plot to get me imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All of that was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then, I wanted to leave the room.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.77,0:20:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's when I noticed\NI wasn't handcuffed anymore.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At that exact moment.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was sitting down\nwhen I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We never left the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jongalli A's Stand{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was an illusion created by my brain.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The secret passage too.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,From the moment we entered the visiting room,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,we fell into their trap\nand were forced to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As if we'd been swallowed by a python,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,slowly but surely,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we're being digested!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The boy in the trash can\nwho gave me this bone,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.91,0:21:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he was real!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I managed to wake up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,because I cut myself with that bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the pain of the cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have stayed asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That power belongs to Jongalli A!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My string! I can't unravel it,\Nnot even a few centimeters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.11,0:21:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting drowsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of this visiting room!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
